{
  "_createdAt": "2026-04-27T21:50:22Z",
  "_id": "wp-post-1463-en",
  "_rev": "37hNSegHf4NtjSKr1qpsf2",
  "_type": "article",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-07-05T16:14:40Z",
  "author": {
    "_ref": "author-legacy-archive",
    "_type": "reference"
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "000000000001",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000000",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egyptian travel products are easy to make look cheap."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000003",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000002",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pyramids, Nile, Red Sea, five-star hotels, cruise. The words are strong, the photos are legible. Inside the same \"Egypt 10 days,\" however, the substance can vary a lot. Which hotel? Which boat? Who is the guide? Are the entry fees included? Are transfers by domestic flight or long road? Is the free time rest, or just nothing arranged?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000005",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000004",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What matters in Egypt is not finding the cheapest. It is understanding what you are paying for."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000007",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt has two kinds of travel product"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000009",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A typical Egypt trip splits in two."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "vx44xyyf8obb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "One is the trip built around ancient Egypt. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "lcaxkjraj980",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "wp0gqzp7sd3j"
          ],
          "text": "Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "y59ivzktgl18",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "kywbnt2juwcj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "i9aponmsdkmp"
          ],
          "text": "Giza"
        },
        {
          "_key": "x6wtb2ur3r5u",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "v8r3jy5iv5ao",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "fu0gpuw5h3cv"
          ],
          "text": "Luxor"
        },
        {
          "_key": "o63xr797a17i",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "43lly16h85cy",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "zfbrkc54dm3h"
          ],
          "text": "Aswan"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6bcnpm7qejfw",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", the Nile cruise, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "chtbbdmx936a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "iqott23ueint"
          ],
          "text": "Abu Simbel"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ga2hbp1b29aq",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". The pyramids, the museums, the temples, the tombs, and movement on the river are the centre."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "wp0gqzp7sd3j",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "i9aponmsdkmp",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "fu0gpuw5h3cv",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58877",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "zfbrkc54dm3h",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "iqott23ueint",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-56813",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "njr5guvrp0ks",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The other is a Red Sea resort trip. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "b7pa2xvj8cv6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "bzzpmid0z41f"
          ],
          "text": "Hurghada"
        },
        {
          "_key": "qlkow0chx7i2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Sharm el-Sheikh, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "h3grqv1jou1g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "ehsm7v3q2pxj"
          ],
          "text": "El Gouna"
        },
        {
          "_key": "b5ij29rm02v4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "7ugkto8lso1d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "1kvu8g97oe3e"
          ],
          "text": "Marsa Alam"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2kqvhtumzyjx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " — hotel, beach, diving, snorkelling, winter sun."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "bzzpmid0z41f",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "ehsm7v3q2pxj",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58740",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "1kvu8g97oe3e",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58885",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Both are Egypt. The character of the trip is completely different. The ancient-Egypt trip is early starts, transfers, listening, walking. The Red Sea trip is hotel stay and time at sea. Cheap packages most commonly fail by mixing the two carelessly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000011",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A good itinerary sees Cairo and the Nile carefully and rests on the Red Sea at the end — or makes the Red Sea the priority and adds one day in Luxor or Cairo. The purpose is clear."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000013",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Things to confirm on a cheap package"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000015",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before looking only at price, confirm what is included."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000017",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kas2avj6aklh",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "International flight included? Domestic flight included? Airport transfer private or shared? Is the Nile cruise boat named? Are entry fees included? Are the extra "
        },
        {
          "_key": "n5hd4n39dg8m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "5qcrsoj19wtn"
          ],
          "text": "Valley of the Kings"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9mxzs5sw876m",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " tombs, Abu Simbel, the GEM, and Philae separate? Does the guide accompany the whole trip or only on-site? How much of the food is included?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "5qcrsoj19wtn",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.valley-of-the-kings",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000019",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Cheap\" packages sometimes show a low base price and push key visits into on-the-ground options. Not inherently bad — compare the final total against the quality of the trip."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Watch transfers from Cairo to Luxor or Aswan especially. Domestic flight vs. overnight train vs. long-distance bus shifts fatigue heavily. On a short itinerary, the cheap transfer can cut into time at the sites."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Look at the boat's name on a Nile cruise"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For a package with a Nile cruise, ask for the boat's name."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000021",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"Five-star cruise\" can mean a wide range. Boat age, refurbishment, food, cabins, guide, and operations all vary. Like hotels, the star rating alone is not enough."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000023",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "22o6bpsgdqk2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The value of a Nile cruise is not just sleeping on a boat. It is moving down the river from Luxor to Aswan, including "
        },
        {
          "_key": "59s2yzepn5eo",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "tfiatrfm5r8p"
          ],
          "text": "Edfu"
        },
        {
          "_key": "boir81fvfm5f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "wp9prst0ou5x",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "23h6sxu0imbf"
          ],
          "text": "Kom Ombo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "xzqiyyj3e21d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", and around "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ls723x659116",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "wofailp2jyys"
          ],
          "text": "Esna"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3x0cw8bxwo32",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Time on board, transfers to temples, the guide's explanation, and visit times that avoid crowds make the experience."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "tfiatrfm5r8p",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58841",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "23h6sxu0imbf",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58875",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "wofailp2jyys",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58844",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000025",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cheap cruises tend toward large boats with ordinary food and sightseeing locked to the group flow. Upper-class boats and dahabiyas cost more; quiet, rooms, service, and visit pace shift."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000027",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What you need is luxury, quiet, or efficiency. Decide and boat selection becomes much clearer."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000029",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Don't save on guide quality"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In Egypt, the guide shifts the trip's quality."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Karnak, the Valley of the Kings, the Egyptian Museum, the GEM, Philae, Abu Simbel. None are places that read themselves. Why this temple was built. What the tomb paintings show. How periods changed. Without explanation, it ends as a sequence of beautiful stones."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In cheap packages, the guide may have less time, the shared group may be too large, and souvenir-shop stops may be more prominent than sightseeing. Confirm."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000031",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000030",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A good guide is not only well-spoken. They read crowding, avoid heat, watch group fatigue, and reorder the visit. In Egypt, that difference is large."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000033",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000032",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Don't make Cairo too short"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000035",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000034",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cheap packages can give Cairo too little time."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000037",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000036",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Arrive, overnight, Giza the next morning, museum in the afternoon, evening transfer. Possible — and you barely understand Cairo."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000039",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "nsmayvz65cwh",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cairo has not only the Giza pyramids but the GEM, the Egyptian Museum on Tahrir, Islamic Cairo, and "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c5kpoa40coei",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "xy60pyqbte39"
          ],
          "text": "Coptic Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "qvesnnknsuau",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". You don't need to see all of them; for a first Egypt trip, at least two nights settles the trip."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "xy60pyqbte39",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-63606",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Giza and the GEM on one day, Islamic Cairo or Coptic Cairo on a half-day to a day. That much makes clear that Egypt is not only ancient."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to use the Red Sea"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If the Red Sea is included, set the purpose."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000041",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000040",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For rest. For diving or snorkelling. For a family hotel stay. For Hurghada as the sea close to Luxor. For Marsa Alam as the quieter southern sea."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000043",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000042",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cheap Red Sea resort packages often run inside the hotel. If that is the purpose, no issue. To see the sea itself, confirm boat-tour quality, house-reef condition, dive centre, and access to protected areas."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000045",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000044",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Placing the Red Sea at the end of the trip allows rest after the dense Nile and Cairo days. The reverse order works for some, but for most travellers, finishing on the sea is more natural."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000047",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000046",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Price and quality change with season"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000049",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000048",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egyptian travel prices shift considerably by season."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "October to April is the main tourism window. Temperatures are workable; Luxor and Aswan walking is easier. December and January crowd and prices climb. November, February, and March often balance weather and crowds."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Summer goes cheaper, but the heat in upper Egypt is real. In Luxor, Aswan, and Abu Simbel, push sightseeing into the early morning. Red Sea resort-only works in summer; combining with sites in summer needs care."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cheap seasons are not bad. Understand why they are cheap and choose with that in view."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000051",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000050",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Hidden costs"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000053",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000052",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In Egypt, costs tend to be added on the ground."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000055",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000054",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Visa, tips, drinks, additional entry tickets, photo tickets, Abu Simbel and other outings, hotel dinners, airport transfers, early-morning breakfast boxes, baggage handling. Small amounts stack."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000057",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000056",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Tipping in particular is part of the service economy. Guides, drivers, boat staff, hotel staff. Confirm typical amounts in advance and carry cash; you won't scramble on the ground."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000059",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000058",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\"All-inclusive\" labels — confirm what is actually included. Meals included with drinks separate, sightseeing included with some entries separate, is not unusual."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Value over price"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A good Egypt holiday package is not only cheap."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Transfers without strain, a hotel in the right place, a strong guide, a sensible visit order, and rest time. None of this shows up in photos; all of it works on the ground."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000061",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000060",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A cheap-looking package — far hotel, too-long bus transfers, too-short site time, oversized groups, an itinerary full of options — can cost more in the end."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000063",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000062",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt rewards planning. A good package does not list places; it sets order and pace."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000065",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000064",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A good itinerary shape"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000067",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000066",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For a first trip, ten to twelve days is the easier length."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000069",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000068",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Two or three nights in Cairo. See Giza and the GEM, plus Islamic Cairo or Coptic Cairo. Two or three nights in Luxor. Split east and west banks. From there to Aswan by Nile cruise or by domestic flight with hotels. In Aswan, Philae and Abu Simbel if you want. Close with two or three nights on the Red Sea."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "With seven days, narrow to Cairo, Luxor, and Aswan. Adding the Red Sea pushes transfers too far."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "With fourteen days, take the Nile slowly and add the Red Sea or desert with margin."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Conclusion"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000071",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000070",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Don't judge an Egypt holiday on price alone."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000073",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000072",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Small differences shift trip quality here significantly. Can you reach the Valley of the Kings early? Is there enough time for Giza and the GEM? Which boat is the Nile cruise? Is the guide someone who can explain? Is the hotel in a movable location? Are the on-the-ground extras visible?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000075",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000074",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The package that is really valuable in Egypt is not the cheapest."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000077",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000076",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "It is the one that protects the time and order required to see this country."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
